# The real GitHub CLI and Git Credential Manager that ci/fetch-real-tools.sh installs for the
# real-tools contract (crates/puddle-secrets/tests/integration/real_tools.rs): <tool> <version> <asset> <sha256>.
# gh: github.com/cli/cli releases (the asset's digest on the release page). gcm: github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager
# releases; the Windows zip holds the same git-credential-manager.exe that Git for Windows bundles.
# Move a pin only together with a green run of .github/workflows/real-tools.yml.
